{#-
  Where the robot is on the floor plan, as JSON with left/top in %, e.g.
  {"left": 41.2, "top": 63.5}. Empty if unknown.

  The robot gives its position in mm on its own map (the vacuum_position
  attribute, see docs/vendored.md). `plan` maps that to the floor plan:
    left = a * x + b * y + c
    top  = d * x + e * y + f
  Fitted from the room boxes in the map integration's diagnostics. Redo it if
  the robot's map or the floor plan changes.
-#}
{%- macro vacuum_plan_position() -%}
  {#- TODO: fit these -#}
  {%- set plan = none -%}
  {%- set pos = state_attr('camera.robot_vacuum_map', 'vacuum_position') -%}
  {%- if plan and pos is mapping -%}
    {{- {
      'left': (plan.a * pos.x + plan.b * pos.y + plan.c) | round(2),
      'top': (plan.d * pos.x + plan.e * pos.y + plan.f) | round(2),
    } | to_json -}}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endmacro -%}
